## Key Management

```java
public void keyOperations() {

    // Check if key exists
    Boolean exists = redisTemplate.hasKey("user:1");

    // Delete single key
    redisTemplate.delete("user:1");

    // Delete multiple keys
    redisTemplate.delete(List.of("user:1", "user:2", "user:3"));

    // Set TTL on existing key
    redisTemplate.expire("user:1", Duration.ofMinutes(30));

    // Get remaining TTL
    Long seconds = redisTemplate.getExpire("user:1", 
                                TimeUnit.SECONDS);

    // Get all keys matching pattern
    Set<String> keys = redisTemplate.keys("user:*");
    // Returns: [user:1, user:2, user:3]

    // Remove TTL (make key permanent)
    redisTemplate.persist("user:1");
}
```

